   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="address">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_STGE_01">​​Hôtel de la Paix</name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>
                                <name type="geo" key="G_FRA_STGE">
                                    <choice>
                                        <sic>S. Gerand-Le Puy</sic> <corr>Saint-Gérand-le-Puy</corr>
                                    </choice>
                                </name>
                            </addrLine>
                            <addrLine>Allier, France</addrLine>
                        </address>
                        <date when="1940-02-27">27/2/40</date>
                    </ab>
                </div>
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <p>Caro Ruggiero: Le sarò molto grato se Lei potrà farmi sapere se il <name type="person" key="vogt79">prof. Vogt</name> è sempre all’Università di Zurigo. Dovrei scrivergli perché è già gran tempo ch’avrei dovuto andarci per la visita medica. Non occorre però fare il mio nome<supplied reason="omitted">.</supplied> Solo La prego di farmelo sapere.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>Una stretta di mano</salute>
                        <signed>
                            <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                        </signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <ab>
                        <address>
                            <addrLine>​​Hôtel de la Paix</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>Saint-Gérand-le-Puy</addrLine>
                            <addrLine>Allier, France</addrLine>
                        </address>
                        <date when="1940-02-27">27/2/40</date>
                    </ab>
                    <p>Dear Ruggiero: I will be most grateful if you would let me know if Prof. Vogt is still at the University of Zurich. I should write to him because I am overdue for a medical appointment. But it is not necessary to mention my name. I only ask you to let me know.</p>
                    <closer>
                        <salute>A handshake</salute> <signed>James Joyce</signed>
                    </closer>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div type="notes">
                <note xml:id="global-note1" type="global">This postcard shows a photograph captioned “SAINT-GÉRAND-le-PUY – Le Pont de la Mule”, the latter being a hamlet in the Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes, close to Saint-Gérand-le-Puy, the village near Vichy in central France to which the Joyce family traveled from Paris in December 1939. Bourbonnais, the historic province in central France once ruled by the Bourbon dynasty, corresponds to the modern département of Allier. The postcard was produced by “Éditions Idéal,” rue Bulot, Vichy.</note>
            </div>
      </body>
